==========================================

inSpectre — Environmental & Threat Intelligence

==========================================

Salin menjadi .env dan isi API key masing-masing.

JANGAN commit .env atau membagikan API key asli.

------------------------------------------

SERVER CONFIGURATION

------------------------------------------

PORT=5000

CORS_ORIGIN=https://domain-frontend-anda.com

TRUST_PROXY=1

------------------------------------------

ENVIRONMENTAL INTELLIGENCE

------------------------------------------

NASA FIRMS — Satellite Fire Hotspot Monitoring

https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/

NASA_FIRMS_MAP_KEY=

OpenAQ — Air Quality Monitoring

https://explore.openaq.org/

OPENAQ_API_KEY=

BMKG — Weather, Warnings & Earthquake Information

Menggunakan endpoint publik, tidak memerlukan API key.

------------------------------------------

DIGITAL SECURITY

------------------------------------------

Google Safe Browsing — URL Threat Reputation

https://developers.google.com/safe-browsing

GOOGLE_SAFE_BROWSING_API_KEY=

Android Asset Packaging Tool — APK Manifest Analysis

Default executable: /usr/bin/aapt

AAPT_PATH=/usr/bin/aapt

------------------------------------------

AI ASSISTANCE

------------------------------------------

OpenRouter — AI Assistant

https://openrouter.ai/

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
